{"id":"8588726b1564520d","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness.md","title":"错位构造的双向正确性","display":"thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness — 错位构造的双向正确性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness","aliases":["73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness"],"display":"thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness — 错位构造的双向正确性","depends_on":["[[73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§9.4.2, Theorem 9.17, print pp. 405–407; PDF pp. 427–429","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":9},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness — 错位构造的双向正确性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eb677533a2953ed4\" href=\"?note=eb677533a2953ed4\" title=\"73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction\">73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.4.2, Theorem 9.17, print pp. 405–407; PDF pp. 427–429"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J(I),\\Sigma,\\Sigma&#39;\">\\(I,J(I),\\Sigma,\\Sigma&#39;\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eb677533a2953ed4\" href=\"?note=eb677533a2953ed4\" title=\"73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction\">73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolveMPCP}_{\\Sigma}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\Sigma&#39;}(J(I)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolveMPCP}_{\\Sigma}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\Sigma&#39;}(J(I)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>MPCP 解先用特殊首块，再按尾列表用普通块，最后用结束块；恒等式 <em>ρ(w)=λ(w)</em> 使两行相等。反向，起始字符迫使先用特殊首块；相邻星号与原字母的交替位置迫使在首个结束标记 以前按普通块对应下去，首个结束标记 必须来自结束块。截到首个结束标记 就恢复强制第 0 块的 MPCP 解。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction","status":"resolved","id":"eb677533a2953ed4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction","status":"resolved","id":"eb677533a2953ed4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I,J(I),\\Sigma,\\Sigma'$ 采用 [[73-df-mpcp-to-pcp-construction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,J(I),\\Sigma,\\Sigma'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SolveMPCP}_{\\Sigma}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SolvePCP}_{\\Sigma'}(J(I)).","display":true}],"bytes":1320,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-mpcp-to-pcp-correctness|错位构造的双向正确性]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["eb677533a2953ed4"]}